[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4620029442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-4620029442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119991","id":4620029442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE2AOAg","user":{"login":"coobenguy","id":76452238,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDUyMjM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76452238?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy","html_url":"https://github.com/coobenguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coobenguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T07:36:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T07:36:58Z","body":"I dont like the way this implemented, we dont really need more non-descriptive arrow buttons in that toolbar imo. Instead I think a better way to do this would be making it so the frame you click on in the editor is what is displayed and hitting the arrow keys on your keyboard can control going a frame forward and a frame back","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4620029442/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4620500266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-4620500266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119991","id":4620500266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE2c9Kg","user":{"login":"masoud-ata","id":54315689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1Njg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata","html_url":"https://github.com/masoud-ata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T08:44:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T08:44:44Z","body":"@coobenguy @kleonc I don't know about removing the buttons or changing icons, as it is a matter of taste, but could be done if that's what people prefer. For now this is how it looks like if you click on a frame or use the stepping buttons:\r\n \r\n<img width=\"2786\" height=\"1778\" alt=\"sprite_frames_single_step_with_click\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/883a6f04-a549-4fe1-a33d-5654bba00a35\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4620500266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4632512415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-4632512415","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119991","id":4632512415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFB6Hnw","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T14:13:20Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T14:13:20Z","body":"> @coobenguy @kleonc I don't know about removing the buttons or changing icons, as it is a matter of taste, but could be done if that's what people prefer.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned I'm not sure about the button placement. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-4620029442 makes a good point, the playback buttons section does feel overcrowded with the new buttons.\r\nBut maybe instead of removing the new buttons, they could be added as a separate section? They don't really belong to the currently present \"automatic/ongoing playback\" section, they are for manual stepping. So:\r\n```\r\n(5 existing playback buttons) | (prev_frame, next_frame) | (other buttons...)\r\n```\r\nOr something alike, worth trying it out I think.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n@masoud-ata Also note the CI checks failed because of style/formatting. I've made my suggestions using web interface here, didn't compile it (thus whitespace mismatches etc. expected). Before applying suggestions / pushing changes you can/should run the format checks etc. locally to ensure everything is correct. See [Automated style checks](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/cpp_usage_guidelines.html#automated-style-checks).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4632512415/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640107157","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-4640107157","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119991","id":4640107157,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFJJqlQ","user":{"login":"masoud-ata","id":54315689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1Njg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata","html_url":"https://github.com/masoud-ata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-06T19:20:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T19:20:49Z","body":"@kleonc It's a good idea. I added the click and go to frame feature and also put the stepping buttons in their own section. This is what it looks like now (latest commit):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2801\" height=\"1788\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d58ef20f-3c45-4426-b103-911834883613\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640107157/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4698611740","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-4698611740","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119991","id":4698611740,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGA8gHA","user":{"login":"masoud-ata","id":54315689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1Njg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata","html_url":"https://github.com/masoud-ata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-13T13:08:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T13:08:49Z","body":"@AdriaandeJongh Makes sense. But what about the case when the user clicks on a frame? Because, based on the latest commit, clicking on a frame in the editor also steps to it. I don't know in this case weather it should also pause the animation like the stepping buttons do, or let  the animation continue playing from the clicked frame (which can be useful).","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4698611740/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4698623223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-4698623223","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119991","id":4698623223,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGA9M9w","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-13T13:13:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T13:13:39Z","body":"I _think_ that should also stop the animation from playing... but that might be out of the scope of this PR?\r\n\r\nAnd on a related note, a playing animation doesn't move the selection to the currently shown frame – whereas your buttons do take the currently shown frame as its starting point to go next of prev in the list, thus moving the selection from one arbitrary frame to another... which doesn't feel good. Perhaps playing an animation should also update the selected frame in real time? Though that could come with consequences I currently do not foresee....","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4698623223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4699146962","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-4699146962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119991","id":4699146962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGBdK0g","user":{"login":"masoud-ata","id":54315689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1Njg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata","html_url":"https://github.com/masoud-ata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masoud-ata/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-13T16:44:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T16:44:50Z","body":"I think it's just better not to update the selection until the user clicks on a frame. So the play and the stepping buttons work without changing the selection highlight.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4699146962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5008115061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119991#issuecomment-5008115061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119991","id":5008115061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKoHFdQ","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-17T22:32:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-17T22:32:16Z","body":"While not in scope of this PR, the animation editors are in severe need of a clean-up. Too many buttons close by one another. Individually the buttons are intuitive, but all together it's easy to lose track of what does what. The PR makes this aspect worse even if it's somewhat useful.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5008115061/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]